#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:1
msgid "引言"
msgstr "Introduction"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:3
msgid "学习目标与核心概念"
msgstr "Learning goals and core concepts"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:5
msgid "在深入探讨计算图、反向传播和梯度下降之前，我们先明确本章的学习目标："
msgstr "Before diving deep into computational graphs, backpropagation, and gradient descent, let us clarify the learning goals for this chapter:"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:7
msgid "学习目标"
msgstr "Learning goals"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:10
msgid "**计算图直觉**：把数学运算看作\"数据流动\"的管道系统"
msgstr "**Computational graph intuition**: View mathematical operations as a plumbing system of \"data flow\""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:11
msgid "**激活函数直觉**：理解非线性如何将线性不可分的数据\"折叠\"成可分"
msgstr "**Activation function intuition**: Understand how non-linearity \"folds\" linearly non-separable data into separable distributions"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:12
msgid "**损失函数直觉**：理解不同目标如何塑造优化问题的几何结构"
msgstr "**Loss function intuition**: Understand how different objectives shape the geometry of optimization problems"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:13
msgid "**反向传播直觉**：把最终误差\"分摊\"给每个参数（信用分配机制）"
msgstr "**Backpropagation intuition**: \"Attribute\" the final error to each parameter (the credit assignment mechanism)"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:14
msgid "**梯度下降直觉**：理解损失曲面的几何形状如何影响优化路径"
msgstr "**Gradient descent intuition**: Understand how the geometry of loss surfaces impacts optimization paths"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:15
msgid "**代码连接**：在PyTorch中观察这些机制的实际表现"
msgstr "**Code connection**: Observe the actual behavior of these mechanisms in PyTorch"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:18
msgid "机器学习的基本问题"
msgstr "The basic problem of machine learning"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:20
msgid "机器学习的目标是让计算机从数据中自己发现规律，而不是我们一条条写规则。核心挑战是如何自动调整模型参数，让它能更好地拟合数据、做出准确预测。"
msgstr "The goal of machine learning is to let computers discover patterns from data autonomously, rather than writing rules line by line ourselves. The core challenge is automatically adjusting model parameters so the model better fits data and makes accurate predictions."

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:22
msgid "机器学习的核心挑战"
msgstr "Core challenges in machine learning"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:25
msgid "**模型复杂度**：现代深度学习模型可能有数百万甚至数十亿个参数"
msgstr "**Model complexity**: Modern deep learning models can have millions or even billions of parameters"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:26
msgid "**优化难度**：在如此高维的空间里找到最优解，就像在迷宫里找出口"
msgstr "**Optimization difficulty**: Finding the optimal solution in such high-dimensional spaces is like finding an exit in a maze"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:27
msgid "**计算效率**：需要又快又省的算法处理海量数据和复杂模型"
msgstr "**Computational efficiency**: Fast and resource-efficient algorithms are required to handle massive datasets and complex models"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:28
msgid "**泛化能力**：模型不仅要在训练数据上表现好，还要在没见过的新数据上靠谱"
msgstr "**Generalization capability**: Models must perform well not only on training data, but also reliably on unseen test data"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:31
msgid "为什么需要这些核心机制？"
msgstr "Why do we need these core mechanisms?"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:33
msgid "神经网络训练涉及几个关键环节，每个环节都需要特定的数学工具："
msgstr "Neural network training involves several key steps, each requiring specific mathematical tools:"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:35
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**{ref}`computational-graph`**：描述数据如何在网络中流动，为自动求导提供结构基础"
msgstr "**{ref}`computational-graph`**: Describes how data flows through the network, laying the structural foundation for automatic differentiation"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:36
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**{ref}`activation-functions`**：引入非线性，让网络能够划分复杂的决策边界"
msgstr "**{ref}`activation-functions`**: Introduces non-linearity, enabling the network to partition complex decision boundaries"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:37
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**{ref}`loss-functions`**：定义\"预测好坏\"的度量，将训练转化为优化问题"
msgstr "**{ref}`loss-functions`**: Defines a metric for \"prediction quality,\" converting training into an optimization problem"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:38
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**{ref}`back-propagation`**：高效计算梯度，完成误差的\"信用分配\""
msgstr "**{ref}`back-propagation`**: Efficiently computes gradients and performs error \"credit assignment\""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:39
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**{ref}`gradient-descent`**：利用梯度信息迭代优化参数"
msgstr "**{ref}`gradient-descent`**: Leverages gradient information to iteratively update parameters"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:41
#, python-brace-format
msgid "这些概念相互配合，构成了现代深度学习框架的核心机制 {cite}`goodfellow2016deep`。"
msgstr "These concepts work together to form the core mechanisms of modern deep learning frameworks {cite}`goodfellow2016deep`."

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:43
msgid "本章预览"
msgstr "Chapter preview"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:45
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"本章我们将从{ref}`computational-graph`开始，建立\"数据流\"的直觉视角。然后理解{ref}`activation-"
"functions`如何用非线性变换在空间中划分决策边界。接着探讨{ref}`loss-"
"functions`如何定义优化目标、塑造损失曲面的几何形状。之后理解{ref}`back-"
"propagation`如何高效地完成\"信用分配\"——把最终误差分摊给每个参数。最后探索{ref}`gradient-"
"descent`如何在损失曲面上寻找最优解。"
msgstr ""
"In this chapter, we will start from {ref}`computational-graph` to establish an intuitive perspective on \"data flow.\" We will then see how {ref}`activation-functions` partition decision boundaries in feature space via non-linear transformations. Next, we will explore how {ref}`loss-functions` define optimization objectives and shape the geometry of the loss surface. After that, we will understand how {ref}`back-propagation` efficiently performs \"credit assignment\"—attributing the final error back to every parameter. Finally, we will explore how {ref}`gradient-descent` navigates loss surfaces to locate optimal parameters."

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:47
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"掌握这些核心机制后，{doc}`the-"
"end`将回顾本章要点，然后下一章我们将用PyTorch构建实际的神经网络，在MNIST任务上观察这些理论如何转化为训练动态。"
msgstr ""
"After mastering these core mechanisms, {doc}`the-end` will review the key points of this chapter. In the next chapter, we will build practical neural networks using PyTorch and observe how these theories translate into training dynamics on the MNIST task."

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:53
msgid "参考文献"
msgstr "References"
